  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Closed Captions\r\n\r\nThe closed captions feature is not working as expected.\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Test the captions switch. What's wrong?\r\n\r\n2. Check the `captionsOn` value and how the captions update.\r\n\r\n3. Fix the issue so the captions show and hide correctly.\r\n\r\nUse AI (if needed) to explain the code before making changes.",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "ai_tutor_mode": "tutor",
    "predict_settings": {
      "isPredictLevel": false,
      "solution": "",
      "questionType": "freeResponse",
      "placeholderText": "",
      "multipleChoiceOptions": [
        ""
      ],
      "freeResponseHeight": 50,
      "codeEditableAfterSubmit": false,
      "allowMultipleAttempts": false
    },
    "display_name": "Fix Captions Toggle",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Investigate and fix a broken captions toggle. Figure out what's wrong and make sure captions show and hide correctly.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/d03031afc37a066ec5620eb49bc1ab8d-caption.png",
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <head>\n    <title>StreamBox</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\" />\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <main class=\"page\">\n      <section class=\"video-card\">\n        <p class=\"app-label\">STREAMBOX</p>\n        <h1 class=\"video-title\">Street Food Tour</h1>\n        <p class=\"video-subtitle\">Clip • 0:18</p>\n\n        <div class=\"video-frame\">\n          <img\n            src=\"food_tour.jpg\"\n            alt=\"Street food vendor preparing food\"\n            class=\"video-image\"\n          />\n\n          <div class=\"video-top-bar\">\n            <span class=\"video-badge\">Food & Travel</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <p id=\"captionText\" class=\"caption-text\">“This one sold out in ten minutes.”</p>\n\n          <div class=\"video-controls\">\n            <div class=\"controls-row\">\n              <button class=\"control-btn\" aria-label=\"Play or pause video\">▶</button>\n              <button class=\"control-btn\" aria-label=\"Volume\">🔊</button>\n              <span class=\"time-label\">0:07 / 0:18</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"progress-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <div class=\"progress-fill\"></div>\n              <div class=\"progress-thumb\"></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"caption-toggle-row\">\n          <span class=\"toggle-label\">Closed captions</span>\n\n          <label class=\"switch\">\n            <input id=\"chkToggle\" type=\"checkbox\" />\n            <span class=\"slider\"></span>\n          </label>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n  </body>\n</html>",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "// State\nlet captionsOn = false;\n\n// Selectors\nconst chkToggle = document.getElementById(\"chkToggle\");\nconst captionText = document.getElementById(\"captionText\");\n\n// Render UI from state\nconst render = () => {\n  if (!captionsOn) { \n    captionText.classList.remove(\"hidden\");\n  } else {\n    captionText.classList.add(\"hidden\");\n  }\n};\n\n// Event: checkbox change -> flip -> render\nchkToggle.addEventListener(\"change\", () => {\n  captionsOn = captionsOn; \n  render();\n});\n\n// Initial render\nrender();",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #081120, #0f172a);\n  color: #ffffff;\n}\n\n.page {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  align-items: center;\n  padding: 24px;\n}\n\n.video-card {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 420px;\n  background: #172235;\n  border-radius: 22px;\n  padding: 20px;\n  box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);\n}\n\n.app-label {\n  margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n  color: #93c5fd;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.video-title {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 30px;\n  line-height: 1.05;\n}\n\n.video-subtitle {\n  margin: 10px 0 18px 0;\n  color: #d1d5db;\n  font-size: 14px;\n}\n\n.video-frame {\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  border-radius: 18px;\n  background: #000000;\n  aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;\n}\n\n.video-image {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  display: block;\n  filter: saturate(1.02);\n}\n\n.video-top-bar {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 12px;\n  left: 12px;\n  right: 12px;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: flex-start;\n}\n\n.video-badge {\n  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);\n  color: #ffffff;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  padding: 6px 10px;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n}\n\n.caption-text {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 16px;\n  right: 16px;\n  bottom: 74px;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 10px 14px;\n  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.72);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1.25;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.video-controls {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 0;\n  right: 0;\n  bottom: 0;\n  padding: 14px 14px 12px 14px;\n  background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.78), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0));\n}\n\n.controls-row {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 10px;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n\n.control-btn {\n  width: 34px;\n  height: 34px;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);\n  color: #ffffff;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  cursor: default;\n}\n\n.time-label {\n  margin-left: auto;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #f3f4f6;\n}\n\n.progress-track {\n  position: relative;\n  height: 6px;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.26);\n  overflow: visible;\n}\n\n.progress-fill {\n  width: 39%;\n  height: 100%;\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n}\n\n.progress-thumb {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: calc(39% - 7px);\n  top: 50%;\n  width: 14px;\n  height: 14px;\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  transform: translateY(-50%);\n}\n\n.caption-toggle-row {\n  margin-top: 18px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n}\n\n.toggle-label {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  color: #e5e7eb;\n}\n\n/* Switch container */\n.switch {\n  position: relative;\n  display: inline-block;\n  width: 44px;\n  height: 24px;\n}\n\n/* Hide default checkbox */\n.switch input {\n  opacity: 0;\n  width: 0;\n  height: 0;\n}\n\n/* Track */\n.slider {\n  position: absolute;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  inset: 0;\n  background-color: #374151;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  transition: 0.2s;\n}\n\n/* Knob */\n.slider::before {\n  content: \"\";\n  position: absolute;\n  height: 18px;\n  width: 18px;\n  left: 3px;\n  top: 3px;\n  background-color: white;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  transition: 0.2s;\n}\n\n/* Checked state */\n.switch input:checked + .slider {\n  background-color: #2563eb;\n}\n\n.switch input:checked + .slider::before {\n  transform: translateX(20px);\n}\n\n.hidden {\n  display: none;\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
